# Design Audit — La PesquerApp

Use this when the user invokes:

- `/audit-design visual [module|route]`
- `/audit-design copy [module]`
- `/audit-design consistency [family]`

Follow:

- `docs/agent-system/workflows/design-audit.md`
- `docs/agent-system/rules/design.md`
- `docs/ai-context/02-ui-conventions.md`
- `docs/ai-context/06-design-system.md`

## Rules

- Audit only; do not implement fixes unless Jose explicitly asks.
- Visual mode prefers screenshots, but heuristic findings must be tagged as
  heuristic.
- Do not download Playwright browser binaries without Jose's approval.
- Copy mode reviews terminology, tone, capitalization and message clarity.
- Consistency mode compares similar UI families and defends the majority pattern.
- Offer GAP creation only after Jose approves findings.
